{"synopsis":"Duan Fei bereinkarnasi 20 tahun lalu, beberapa jam sebelum penyakit virus, setelah dia meninggal. Duan Fei menyesal untuk mereka 20 tahun akhirnya dapat dimasukkan ke beristirahat dengan memanfaatkan nya kehidupan sebelumnya 20 tahun kebijaksanaan untuk memberdayakan dirinya di dunia sekarang. Duan Fei terus memperkuat kekuatannya setelah mendapatkan pohon evolusi. Dalam eksistensi, ia adalah satu-satunya yang selamat; sekarang, dalam inkarnasi ini, dia adalah pahlawan dunia…","alternative_title":"人生リセットで守護者に覚醒","author":"MOKF, 兔子专吃窝边草","artist":"黑鸟社","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"221cf039-9ecc-4ccd-ae21-2495fd569cdb","number":"180","chapter":"180","title":"","date":"2026-07-20","released":"2026-07-20"},{"chapter_id":"1316655e-d681-462f-bcb2-1609a8ab8c75","number":"179","chapter":"179","title":"","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-07-19"},{"chapter_id":"1b10f816-08d1-438a-8051-6468ce8f4a70","number":"178","chapter":"178","title":"","date":"2026-07-18","released":"2026-07-18"},{"chapter_id":"392b9b51-692b-46e4-b0d8-ae45cb83cf07","number":"177","chapter":"177","title":"","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17"},{"chapter_id":"366c218f-f9b5-4994-8657-977681417515","number":"176","chapter":"176","title":"","date":"2026-07-16","released":"2026-07-16"},{"chapter_id":"fca7e729-7c44-4d1c-b8b4-9b69ac755199","number":"175","chapter":"175","title":"","date":"2026-07-15","released":"2026-07-15"},{"chapter_id":"7abe876d-14fb-46aa-98cc-42aa549b3550","number":"174","chapter":"174","title":"","date":"2026-07-14","released":"2026-07-14"},{"chapter_id":"d479572c-b8ca-4ca6-8ca2-2f2db60c49db","number":"173","chapter":"173","title":"","date":"2026-07-13","released":"2026-07-13"},{"chapter_id":"d3fad18b-1f37-42b6-9509-0ff47240f192","number":"172","chapter":"172","title":"","date":"2026-07-12","released":"2026-07-12"},{"chapter_id":"4088ea2f-b161-4f01-927a-fbe5795a0288","number":"171","chapter":"171","title":"","date":"2026-07-11","released":"2026-07-11"},{"chapter_id":"76